:: OC Kazu The Tattoo [nobr]

/* Intro */
As you are finishing up and prepping to leave the locker room to be done with the day, you notice <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span>, recently dressed and closing his locker, <span style="color:Yellow">rubbing his eyes with an uncomfortable look on his face.</span> Curious, you walk over and ask him what’s wrong. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Fucking pool water.”</span> He spits, looking equally frustrated and annoyed, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“The cholerine already bugs the shit out of my eye and sometime I feel like they add extra just to spite me! Dumb ass fucking- AH!”</span> He shouts, kicking the lockers in annoyance. <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Kazu",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Eyes: "Mad",
                Blush: 1,
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey! Who’s making so much noise out there!? Class is over, get your butts out of here!”</span> Kohler calls out, being the cue for you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> to leave, retreating into the hallway with a smirk. Though his smile doesn’t last, <span style="color:Yellow">as his false eye once again begins to bug him and he begins to rub his shirt up against it, groaning in annoyance.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Fucking-! It’s like coated in the stuff!”</span> He sighs, giving up trying to clean it like this, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I gotta go to the nurse’s to clean it. I could do it at home, but there’s no way in hell I’m sitting on a hot bus for 20 minutes with an itchy, irritated eye socket.”</span> You chuckle in response, <span style="color:Yellow">though the mention of his eye socket being itchy causing you to shiver a little.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Don’t be such a baby! Hey, wanna come with? It’ll take the nurse a few minutes to clean it and he makes me sit there the entire time; it’s so fucking boring! You’ll miss the bus, but look on the bright side, you get to hang out with me. That’s a reward in itself.”</span> He smirks, pointing to himself with his thumbs. <br>
<br>

<div id="Choice1">
	<<link "Agree<br>">>
	<<replace"#Choice1">>
        <<set $Minutes += 10>>
        <span style="color:LightGreen">You shrug and agree, seeing it as a fun way to kill time. Besides, you’d hate to leave <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> all alone. He’d probably die of boredom without your presence!</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, shove it!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> chuckles as the two of you head to Dr. Bertram’s office. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> tries his hardest to avoid rubbing his false eye anymore on the way, but quickly loses this battle just due to how itchy it is! When he enters the office frantically rubbing his eye with the palm of his hand, Bertram can already tell what is going on and chuckles. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“They used too much chlorine again? You really should ask Kohler if you could wear goggles during swimming class. It would stop this from happening.”</span> Bertram explains, grabbing and holding out a small cloth rag that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> puts his eye on after he pulls it out. <span style="color:Yellow">You either look away when he does this or look a little too closely.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, and look like some nerd?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> scoffs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No thanks. I’m not going to be the only one in class wearing dumb ass googles just to avoid some itchy eyes.”</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Language.”</span> Bertram says, though sounding more like an obligation than an actual command, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Alright. I’ll just be a few minutes. Wait here and try not to play with anything, okay?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> salutes the doctor as he walks away, before immediately beginning to wander around the office touching and picking up various bottles. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Cleaning alcohol?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> reads as he holds up the small brown bottle, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You know, I knew a kid that drank this once thinking he’d get drunk. Fucking idiot was throwing up for like 10 minutes! Then he started acting all drunk like he didn’t just puke it all out. He was such a loser.”</span> You both laugh as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span>, looking a little mischievous, unscrews the lid of the bottle and holds it out to you. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Dare you to take a swig.”</span> <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Player",
                    State: {
                        Mouth: "Frown",
                        Blush: 1,
                    },
                },
                {
                    Name: "OC Kazu",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Uniform",
                        Mouth: "Smirk",
                        Eyes: "Right Wink",
                    },
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="color:Yellow">Your eyes widen at the suggestion. There’s no way you’re going to do that! Especially not after the story he just shared.</span> Plus, you’re pretty sure drinking pure cleaning alcohol is like REALLY bad for you. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> laughs, calling you a <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Coward”</span>, though you don’t take the bait. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Fine, suit yourself. More for me!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> holds the bottom up to his lips, looking like he is going to take a drink! Your eyes widen as you hold your hand out, instinctively shouting out that he shouldn’t do that. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> pauses as he sees your reaction and starts to laugh. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Haha, you’re fucking face! Come on dude, I’m not an idiot! Can’t believe you actually believed I would do something that dumb-”</span> <br>
        <br>
        As <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> goes to put the cap back on, <span style="color:LightCoral">his hand slips and suddenly he splashes his shirt, coating it in the liquid as the smell quickly fills the surrounding area! You back up, covering your face as you try hard not to laugh, while <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> gags and quickly covers his nose as he puts the bottle back down.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Fuck dude! That shit is strong!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> begins to cough and gag some more, quickly ripping off his shirt and tossing it into the trashcan in an attempt to get away from the overwhelming odor. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Damn, that was like half the bottle! Think the doc will notice?”</span> He gives you a smirk as he wipes some of the residue off his chest, sniffing his hand and cringing at the lingering smell. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I gotta wipe this shit off and grab my gym shirt before anyone sees me. Last thing I need is a teacher getting on my ass.”</span> <br>
        <br>
        <<linkreplace"Continue">>
            As <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> turns away from you, <span style="color:Yellow">you freeze as you finally see the full tattoo on his back.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> wasn’t kidding before, as the tattoo covers most of his back and is a very detailed, intricate piece. <span style="color:Yellow">It is of a cherry blossom branch, at least you think it is due to the pink leaves. It branches out from his spine, almost looking like it is bursting out from inside him, with branches wrapping around his back. Three branches seem to be prominent than the others, in full bloom and much larger. Each of these three branches have roman numerals carved into the edges of them and you quickly deduce that they must be dates based on their formatting.</span> <br>

                <<set _ad to [
                    {
                        Name: "Player",
                        State: {
                            Mouth: "Frown",
                            Blush: 1,
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        Name: "OC Kazu",
                        State: {
