	<<link "Refuse<br>">>
	<<replace"#Choice1">>
        <span style="color:Yellow">You tell him you can’t make it, since you have plans or really need to get home. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> looks a little disappointed but then scoffs.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Shit, whatever. I don’t care. You’re just better than nothing.”</span> Despite his words, you can tell he was hoping you’d join him; he does seem to secretly enjoy your company, at least a little bit. You apologize, telling him that maybe next time you’ll join him. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Like I said, I no care. See ‘ya later dude.”</span> <br>
        <br>
        He waves you off nonchalantly as he walks to the nurse’s office, leaving you to start heading towards the buses. <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|School East Hallway]]
